  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard\" style=\"width:22em; font-size:88%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"adr\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\" class=\"mergedtoprow\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.25em 0.33em 0.33em;line-height:1.2em;font-size:1.25em;\"><span class=\"fn org country-name\">Republic of Sahtu</span><br /></th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n          <td class=\"maptable\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.5em 0;\"><table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;background:none;\"><tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align:middle;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/79/Sahtu_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20170811205324\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Republic of Sahtu\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/7/79/Sahtu_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20170811205324\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sahtu Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Sahtu_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td>\n              </tr><tr>\n              <td style=\"text-align:center;font-size:85%;\">Flag</td>\n              </tr></tbody></table>\n          </td>\n        </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b></td><td>Deline</td></tr>\n             <tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n               <th colspan=\"2\">Largest city</th>\n               <td>New Inuvik</td></tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"></th>\n         <td>Dene, English</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Government</th>\n         <td>Republic</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">President</td>\n         <td>Grey Sun</td>\n       </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\">Legislature</th>\n         <td>Secretariat</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Upper_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Upper house\">Upper house</a></td>\n         <td>Tribal Council</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_house\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Lower house\">Lower house</a></td>\n         <td>General Assembly</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\"><th colspan=\"3\">Independence from the Canada</th></tr><tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n         <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n         <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">Plebiscite</td>\n         <td>&#160;</td>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n         <th colspan=\"3\">Population</th>\n       </tr><tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n            <td style=\"width:1.0em;padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n            <td style=\"padding-left:0;\">estimate</td>\n            <td>579,012</td>\n          </tr><tr>\n         <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">Currency</th>\n           <td>Canadian Dollar (<a href=\"/wiki/ISO_4217\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISO 4217\">CAD</a>)</td>\n       </tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Sahtu </b> was an independent sovereign country in the North American Arctic that existed until January 10, 2073. Sahtu was bordered by Yukon to the west, Tlicho to the south, and the Nunavut to the East. The native citizens of Sahtu were predominantly of Dene and Metis ancestry, however the bulk of the country's population were from the British Isles and the former Low Countries.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRepublic_of_Sahtu%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sahtu was the wealthiest and most powerful of the First Nations. Perfectly situated along the Mackenzie river with wide harbors to move goods from the Northwest Passage to and fro from further south, Sahtu rose to wealth and prominence in the mid-21st Century. While power did rest in the wealthy chiefs on the Tribal Council, the country's population was largely made up for British, Australian, and Dutch climate refugees, with a small population of ex-Russian oil and gas workers.<br />\n<br />\nLike all of the Arctic States, Sahtu's economy collapsed during the Refreeze and most of its population fled South, literally to greener pastures. With its economy in ruins, but still holding a not inconsiderable military force, Sahtu joined forces with the other Arctic states in a desperate bid to take hold of better lands further south to resettle its population and rebuild its economy rather than return to the life they'd known for so long prior to the Flood. Taking advantage of a weakened Canada with their own economic problems, Sahtu hoped to wage a brief skirmish to force the Canadians to a political settlement, however the invasion dragged on into a war that would eventually bring in the United States and see Canada and the First Nations under an American occupation.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261113054244\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 474/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6276/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 512/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 3/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.246      1 Template:Infobox_country\n100.00%   26.246      1 -total\n 11.13%    2.922      1 Template:Yesno\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1919-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261113054244 and revision id 6668. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
